markdown <<MARKDOWN
# Impact of AI on Education

The following scenarios highlight real classroom and school-based examples that show both productive uses of AI and potential concerns.

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 12px; margin-top: 15px;">

<!-- Scenario 1 -->
<div style="background:#fff; padding:15px; text-align:center; border-radius:8px; box-shadow:0 3px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); border:2px solid #5a2ca0; font-size:18px;">
<img 
  src="https://images.code.org/30831693a9af52d9b35e411a5f7d73d0-Screenshot 2026-05-28 at 3.22.41 PM.png" 
  alt="Illustrated classroom scenario involving AI use" 
  style="
    width:100%;
    height:200px;
    object-fit:cover;
    border-radius:6px;
    margin-bottom:10px;
    background:#ececec;
  ">
<p style="font-size:14px;">
A 10th-grade student submits a polished history essay on the Civil Rights Movement that was generated almost entirely by AI. During peer review, classmates ask questions about specific events and sources mentioned in the essay. The student struggles to explain key events or arguments from the essay.
</p>
</div>

<!-- Scenario 2 -->
<div style="background:#fff; padding:15px; text-align:center; border-radius:8px; box-shadow:0 3px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); border:2px solid #5a2ca0; font-size:18px;">
<img 
  src="https://images.code.org/0d6ffec80b1a1b1fa9fc0e1220a8484c-Screenshot 2026-05-28 at 3.22.49 PM.png"
  alt="Illustrated classroom scenario involving AI use" 
  style="
    width:100%;
    height:200px;
    object-fit:cover;
    border-radius:6px;
    margin-bottom:10px;
    background:#ececec;
  ">
<p style="font-size:14px;">
A 4th-grade science teacher uses AI to generate reading passages about ecosystems at multiple reading levels, including simplified texts and vocabulary supports for English learners. The teacher reviews and edits the content to ensure accuracy and appropriateness. Students work on the same topic while accessing materials that match their reading ability.
</p>
</div>

<!-- Scenario 3 -->
<div style="background:#fff; padding:15px; text-align:center; border-radius:8px; box-shadow:0 3px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); border:2px solid #5a2ca0; font-size:18px;">
<img 
  src="https://images.code.org/8ee766dde3237dfb7be3b2d077671908-Screenshot 2026-05-28 at 3.22.54 PM.png" 
  alt="Illustrated classroom scenario involving AI use" 
  style="
    width:100%;
    height:200px;
    object-fit:cover;
    border-radius:6px;
    margin-bottom:10px;
    background:#ececec;
  ">
<p style="font-size:14px;">
A high school student uses AI to generate examples for a career research assignment about healthcare careers. Across multiple prompts, the AI consistently describes doctors as men and nurses as women. The student begins noticing the repeated patterns and stereotypes.
</p>
</div>


<!-- Scenario 4 -->
<div style="background:#fff; padding:15px; text-align:center; border-radius:8px; box-shadow:0 3px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); border:2px solid #5a2ca0; font-size:18px;">
<img 
  src="https://images.code.org/d9bce23a77cf90b2c4a68946df2274ca-Screenshot 2026-05-28 at 3.23.00 PM.png" 
  alt="Illustrated classroom scenario involving AI use" 
  style="
    width:100%;
    height:200px;
    object-fit:cover;
    border-radius:6px;
    margin-bottom:10px;
    background:#ececec;
  ">
<p style="font-size:14px;">
A middle school social studies teacher uses AI to help generate background information for a lesson on a current events topic. The AI provides several confident but incorrect or outdated facts mixed in with accurate information. Without carefully verifying the content, the teacher includes some of the misinformation in the lesson materials shared with students.</p>
</div>

</div>
<br>

>💬 **Quick Reflection:** Which of these feels most similar to something you've seen or experienced in your own school/classroom?
MARKDOWN
